OL,3,GNEWSAParamedics experiment with AI
OL,4,Anote-taking tool
OL,5,
OL,6,FParamedics are experimenting with the
OL,7,Fuse of AI assistants in frontline
OL,8,Fservices.
OL,10,FNorth East Ambulance Service (NEAS)
OL,11,Fsaid it was in the middle of an
OL,12,Feight-week trial studying the
OL,13,Feffectiveness of technology that
OL,14,Frecords, transcribes and summarises
OL,15,Fpatient conversations.
OL,17,FIt said 38 individuals, ranging from
OL,18,Fparamedics to operational staff, were
OL,19,Finvolved in the study and that it hoped
OL,20,Fthe software may reduce staff workload.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
