OL,3,GNEWSAParamedics experiment with AI
OL,4,Anote-taking tool
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisation's digital clinical
OL,7,Flead Georgina Campbell said the trial
OL,8,Fwould help the team better understand
OL,9,Fhow emerging technology could be used
OL,10,F"safely and effectively".
